# Unit08
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 必考词Unit08核心词汇

forge/fɔːrdʒ/锻造；伪造/He forged a career in the music industry.
formula/ˈfɔːrmjələ/公式/She memorized the mathematical formula.
forth/fɔːrθ/向前/From that day forth, everything changed.
fortune/ˈfɔːrtʃən/运气；财富/He made a fortune in the stock market.
fossil/ˈfɑːsl/化石/Scientists discovered a new fossil in the desert.
foundation/faʊnˈdeɪʃn/基础；基金会/The organization is a charitable foundation.
fraction/ˈfrækʃn/分数；小部分/Only a fraction of the students passed the exam.
framework/ˈfreɪmwɜːrk/框架/We need a legal framework for the new policy.
franchise/ˈfræntʃaɪz/特许经营权/He bought a fast-food franchise.
frequent/ˈfriːkwənt/频繁的/Frequent exercise keeps you healthy.
friction/ˈfrɪkʃn/摩擦/There is friction between the two departments.
frontier/frʌnˈtɪr/边界；前沿/Space is the final frontier for exploration.
frustrate/frʌˈstreɪt/使沮丧/The lack of progress frustrated the team.
fulfill/fʊlˈfɪl/实现/She fulfilled her childhood dream.
function/ˈfʌŋkʃn/功能/What is the function of this button?
fund/fʌnd/基金/The government will fund the research project.
fundamental/ˌfʌndəˈmentl/基本的/Freedom of speech is a fundamental right.
furnish/ˈfɜːrnɪʃ/提供；布置/She furnished the apartment with modern furniture.
furthermore/ˌfɜːrðərˈmɔːr/此外/The plan is too expensive; furthermore, it is impractical.
generate/ˈdʒenəreɪt/产生/Wind turbines generate clean energy.
generation/ˌdʒenəˈreɪʃn/一代人/The younger generation is more open-minded.
genuine/ˈdʒenjuɪn/真正的/This is a genuine diamond ring.
gesture/ˈdʒestʃər/手势/He made a gesture of welcome.
global/ˈɡloʊbl/全球的/Climate change is a global issue.
govern/ˈɡʌvərn/统治/Laws govern how we behave in society.
gradual/ˈɡrædʒuəl/逐渐的/There has been a gradual improvement in his health.
grant/ɡrænt/拨款/The university received a large research grant.
gravity/ˈɡrævəti/重力；严重性/The gravity of the situation cannot be ignored.
guarantee/ˌɡærənˈtiː/保证/The product comes with a money-back guarantee.
guard/ɡɑːrd/守卫/The guard stood at the entrance.
guilty/ˈɡɪlti/有罪的/He was found guilty of fraud.
halt/hɔːlt/停止/Production was halted due to the strike.
handle/ˈhændl/处理/She handled the situation very well.
harbor/ˈhɑːrbər/港口；庇护/The ship arrived at the harbor at dawn.
harmony/ˈhɑːrməni/和谐/We should live in harmony with nature.
harsh/hɑːrʃ/严酷的/The harsh winter made travel difficult.
harvest/ˈhɑːrvɪst/收获/The farmers celebrated a good harvest.
haste/heɪst/匆忙/Haste makes waste.
haunt/hɔːnt/萦绕/The memory of the accident haunted him for years.
highlight/ˈhaɪlaɪt/亮点/The report highlights the need for reform.
hinder/ˈhɪndər/阻碍/Bad weather hindered the rescue efforts.
horizon/həˈraɪzn/地平线/There are new opportunities on the horizon.
hostile/ˈhɑːstl/敌意的/The hostile crowd threw stones at the police.
household/ˈhaʊshoʊld/家庭的/Household expenses have increased this year.
housing/ˈhaʊzɪŋ/住房/The city needs more affordable housing.
humble/ˈhʌmbl/谦虚的/Despite his success, he remains humble.
identical/aɪˈdentɪkl/完全相同的/The two paintings look identical.
identify/aɪˈdentɪfaɪ/识别/Can you identify the man in the photo?
identity/aɪˈdentəti/身份/He refused to reveal his identity.
ideology/ˌaɪdiˈɑːlədʒi/意识形态/Different political parties have different ideologies.
